          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Dec 08 2021 17:03:04 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p>Stryker’s Chair and CEO, Kevin Lobo, and Group President of MedSurg and Neurotechnology, Andy Pierce, recently discussed company updates on <a href=\"https://www.devicetalks.com/lobo-and-pierce-talk-wright-cool-tech-robotics-and-the-not-so-secret-plans-to-keep-stryker-growing/\">DeviceTalks Weekly</a>, a podcast covering the MedTech space.</p>\n<p>Offering insight on a diverse range of topics, Kevin highlighted how Stryker’s specialization continues driving our category leadership in delivering value for our customers.</p>\n<p>The two leaders also touched on our innovative technologies, M&amp;A and integration strategy, and meeting our customers across the continuum of care.</p>\n<p>“If you understand our history, patient safety and caregiver safety is in our DNA,” said Andy, tracing the line from Dr. Homer Stryker’s inventions up to our latest innovations. “We are always seeking to help our customers achieve their mission of safer patient care.”</p>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"https://www.devicetalks.com/lobo-and-pierce-talk-wright-cool-tech-robotics-and-the-not-so-secret-plans-to-keep-stryker-growing/\">LISTEN TO THE EPISODE&nbsp;</a></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Dec 08 2021 17:08:44 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
